# Development and release-only files
build.spec
BiliArchive-Pro-v*.zip
本地任务计划与执行表.md

# tests/ stays in the build context: the backend-test image target runs it.
# The runtime image never copies it in.
!tests
!tests/**

# Docker 的语义是"最后一个匹配的规则生效"，上面的 !tests/** 会把 tests 目录
# 整体重新包含，进而把本地跑 pytest 留下的字节码也带回上下文（每次本地测试
# 都会让 COPY tests 层缓存失效，镜像内容也不干净）。这里在包含之后再显式排除，
# 保证 "tests 源码进上下文、tests 下的字节码不进"。
tests/**/__pycache__
tests/**/*.py[cod]

# Host operating-system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
